<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">Peter Khatna</book>
  <para style="h">Peter Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Peter Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Peter Khatna</para>
  <para style="mt">Peter Khatna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus Christ ii sawltak Peter in — Pontus, Galatia, Cappadocia, Asia le Bithynia ngamte ah ngaltai a, a kithethaang Pathian tealsa mite tungah lai kong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No sia Pa Pathian tupna taw hong tealsa hi a, Jesus Christ thu a ni tu le a chisan taw a kithiansua tu in, ama Thaa taw a thiangtho minam a suak sate na hi uh hi. Thuthiamna le thinnopna note sungah hong dim tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa Jesus Christ ii Pa le Pathian tungah lungdamko tawng! Hong hesuakna lian ahikomin, Jesus Christ sia thina pan a thawsak kikna taw nuntakna thak eite hong pia hi. Hi sia in a nungta lametna taw hong dimh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua ahikom a mite atu Pathian ii a koi, a thupha tam mamate a nei tu in ih kilamen hi. Ama in note atu in tua thuphate vantung ah keam a, tua munah muat thei ngawl, lal thei ngawl le vul thei ngawlin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua teng sia noma atu ahi hi, hun tawpkhak ni ciang a kilaak khia tu a kinging sa in a om, ngupna sia upna tungtawnin a nga note atu in, Pathian vaang taw tuate hong kepcingsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thuak uh haksatna namcin hu in tu laitak hun tawm vei no sung khuangaina na thuak uh kul hikale, hi thute ah lungdam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua haksatna thuaknate ii tupna in na upna uh a maanna a kilak natu ahi hi. A kisia thei khamh ngawngawn zongh meisa taw kisit lai hi; tua ahikom khamh sangin tam mama in a man nei zaw na upna uh zongh a kip thei natu in hong kisit tu hi. Tua hile Jesus Christ hong kilaak Ni tak ciangin pokna, minthanna le vaang piakna na saang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama mu ngeingawl na hi uh hang na it uh a, tu zongh in ama mu ngawl na hi uh hang na um uh hi. Tua ahikomin, kam taw a kison zo ngawl dongin lungdamna lianpi taw nasia takin na lawp uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ama na upna uh hu in na upna uh ii tupna bulpi a hi thaa ngupna sia na saang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kamsaangte ii pha tak a zon le a kat sia hi ngupna thu hi a, Pathian ii no tung hong piak tu hi letsong huvau amate in sonkhol zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in tua thu sia bang hun ciang tung tu a, bangbang hong pai tu ziam cisia, heak tu in hanciam uh hi. Tua hun sia Christ in ngim thuak tu a, tua zawkciang minthanna taw kizom tu hi ci in amate sung a, a om Christ Thaa ii a sonkholna taw a lak hun sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vantung panin Thaa Thiangtho ii vang taw a sawl, Lungdamna Thupha a thangsak, thupuakte tung pan tu in na zaak uh thute Pathian in hi kamsaangte tungah a pualaakna ah cileang, amate nasep sia in amate phattuam na tu in a seam hi ngawl a, noma atu in a seam hizaw hi. Hi thute sia vantunglalangte dong ii a tel nop uh thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom a diang tu in, na thin sung uh ah kingin khol tavun. Jesus Christ hong kilangh ciangin, note hong piak tu thupha tungah lametna a cingin nei tavun, na kipilvangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian thu ni vun, tuaciang bangma na heak ma na nei uh, deinate in na nuntakna uh uksak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua hi ngawl zaw in, na sep na vawt theampo sungah note hong sam Pathian a thiantho bangma in thiangtho vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Kei thiangtho ka hikom na thiangtho vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing khat sim ii a sepna bangin a kibang thukhenna taw mihing theampo thu a khen Pathian tungah thu na nget uh ciang, Pa awng, na ci uh hi; tua ahiciang hi leitung ah nungta in na om uh laiteng ama thasia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile na taanghpupite pan na luasuk uh, a mannung ngawl nuntakzia pan na suatak natu in, note bang taw hong tan ci thu na he uh hi. Ngunn le khamh bangin a kisia thei thilte taw hong kilei hi ngawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a sitbaang ngawl, ahibuale a mealhem ngawl tuuno, Christ ii a manpha a kipumpiakna taw hong tan a hina he tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama sia simlei a kibitphua ma in, Pathian teal kholsa hi a, hi ni tawpkhak nite sungah no atu hong kilaak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama thina pan a thosak, minthanna a pia Pathian sia ama tungtawnin na um uh hi; tuaciang note upna le lametna sia Pathian tungah kibul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu in thumaan thutak na zui uh hu in, noma le noma na kithiansua zo uh a, na thu uppui mihingte it zo takpi tu na hi uhkom na thin theampo uh taw khat le khat nasia takin ki it tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a nungta tawntung Pathian kammal tungtawnin, a thi maw a nungta tawntung nu le pa khat ii tate bangin, na piangthak zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Mihing theampo sia lopa bang hi a, amate ii minthanna sia duisung paakte taw kibang hi. Tua lopa ko a, tua paakte pul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang Topa kammal sia a tawntungin kip hi,” ci hi. Hi kammal sia no tung a hong kithangsak tua Lungdamna Thupha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahiciang siatna a minpiang vawk siat in; leilotna, kihitheamsakna, ki eenna, ahibuale kiselnona kam note sungah om nawn heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nausen suaktuungte bangin a thiangtho thaa noaitui tatak du tawntung tavun, tuabang a na neakna taw in na khangto tu uh a, ngupna na nga tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Noma mama in, Topa sia bangza in dik ziam ci in na mu zo uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihingte in mannung ngawl hi ci in nial hikale Pathian ii manpha a sak, a teal, a nungta suangpi ahi, Topa kungah pai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nuntakna a nei suangte bangin pai tavun a, thaa biakinn sak natu in a kizanghte hi tavun, tua munah Jesus Christ tungtawnin, Pathian tungah a saan thamman, thaa taw kisai sangaw biakpiakna a pia a thiangtho thiampite bangin na seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “A man nei suang khat ka teal a, Zion ah innkingh suang tu in ka phut hi, tuaciang ama a um peuma in, a thin a kiam ngei buatu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />No a umte atu in hi suang sia man nei mama hi; ahihang a um ngawlte atu in: inn sate ii mannung a sak ngawl, a nial suang sia a vekpi sung pan a thupibel hong suak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Laithiangtho mundang khat ma ah, “Hi suang in mihingte lutusak tu a, amate a liiksak suangpi suak tu hi,” ci hi. Kammal a up ngawl manin amate lutu uh hi; tuasia in amate atu in Pathian ii deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang note sia a kiteal sa minam, Kumpi thiampite, a thiangtho minam, Pathian ii aituam mite, khuazing sung pan a lamdang ama ii khuavak sungah nang hong sam pa Pathian ii a lamdang ngamtatnate a thangsak tu a hong tealsate na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hun khat lai in, note sia Pathian mite na hi bua uh hi, ahihang tu in ama mite na hi uh hi; hun khat lai in, Pathian ii hesuakna na he bua uh hi, ahihang tu in ama ii hesuakna na saang zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi leitung ah khualmite le ngaltaite ahi no ka lawmte tungah hi bangin, kong thuum nuam hi! Na pumpi cii le sa deinate zawp heak vun, tuate in thaa taw kido tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian he ngawlte kawm ah na ngamtatna uh a phat mama hu in amate ii mihing tatsiate ci a hong zungkaw ciangin, na ngamtatna phate hong mu tu a, ama hong pai Ni ciangin, Pathian pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa hangin mihing thunei peuma ii ukna nuai ah om tavun: a lianbel thunei ahi Kumpilianpa le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />mihing tatsiate daan pia tu le, thupha a vawtte a pok tu in a koi, ngamkhen uk maangte khutnuai ah na om tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a pha na vawt uhte taw, mihing mawmawte ii a mot paunate na thimsak tu uh Pathian in hong deisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A suakta mite bangin nungta vun; ahizong ngitlo ngamtatnate seal natu in na suatakna uh zangh heak vun a, Pathian ii silate bangin nungta tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing theampo zatak vawt vun, na thu uppuite it vun, Pathian thasiana nei vun a, Kumpilianpa zakta vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />No naseamte in a dik thukhual theite bek hi ngawlin, a thuthiam ngawl a thinngam na tote zongh zatakna a cingin pia vun, amate ukna nuai ah na om uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama deina na phawna uh hu in, ngimthuak ngawl tu bul na thuak uh le, hite tungtaang ah, Pathian in thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile na khialna hangin velna na thuak le bang phattuamna om na ziam? Ahihang a maan na sep uh ciang ngawngawn in na thuak veve uh le, Pathian in tua hu in thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian in no hong sapna sia hi thu hang ahi hi, banghang ziam cile Christ ama mama in, no atu in thuak a, ama khuani na zui thei natu in ettee tu hong nusiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in mawna vawt ngawl a, ama kam panin leilot thu pusuak hi ci in kuama in za ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama a kilan ciangin selnona kam taw thuk ngawl hi; ngimna a thuak ciang kuama tawng ngawl a thutang thukhenpa Pathian tungah a lametna koi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eite, mawna sungah thi a, thutang suana sungah ih nuntak thei natu in, Christ ama mama in, thinglamtee tungah a pumpi taw ih mawnate hong puaksak zo hi. Ama liammate taw note hong damsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note sia lam amh tuute bang na hi uh hi, ahihang tu in na thaa uh hong Keampa le Tuucingpa zui tu in, hong kipui kik zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in, no zite awng na pasalte khat po Pathian thu um ngawl a om le, na ngamtatna taw Pathian thu um khat na suasak thei natu in na pasalte thu na nit uh kul hi. Kam khat zongh na pau kul ngawl tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />banghang ziam cile amate in noma ngamtatna sia bangza thiangtho in thasiahuai ziam ci in hong mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na hoi natu sam vawtzia taw, suangmanphate taw, nikteen puansilh daan taw, tuabang tungtham kipuuanate taw, kizeam heak vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuate taangin na hoina sungah Pathian ii muna ah a man neibel ahi a tul thei ngawl, a dik cikna thiamna le thinsung pha na nei tu uh hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A bosa hun sung biakna sungah a takkha, Pathian tungah lametna a neite sia, a pasalte thu a nitna uh taw a mealhoi veu suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sarah zongh tuabang ma ahi hi; Abraham ii thu ni a, ama sia topa ci in sam hi. Na pha seamin bangma sep kiitak na nei buana uh le, tu in no sia Sarah ii tanute na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in no pasalte zongh, na zite uh thaneam zaw ahi hunlam telthiam in na nuntakpui tu uh kul hi. Amate zatak vawt tavun, banghang ziam cile, amate zongh noma taw kibangin, Pathian ii nuntakna letsong sia sang khawm tu uh hi. Tuabangin na ngamta uhle na thungetna uh bangma in hong nawngkaisak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tawpna ah: note theampo in a kibang ngaisutna le khuaheakna nei tavun; tuaciang khat le khat unau bangin ki it vun. Khat le khat tungah dikin, kiniamkhiak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngitlona sia ngitlona taw thuk kik heak vun a, haamsiatna zongh haamsiatna taw thuk kik heak vun; tua hi ngawl zaw in thupha taw kithuk zaw vun, banghang ziam cile, note Pathian hong sap lai in piak tu a hong kamciam sia thupha hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Laithiangtho in: “Nuntak nuamin a nungta nuamte le hunphate a mu nuamte in, kam sia pau heak hen a, leilot thuson kheal nanak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in siatna pan kikhealin phatna vawt nanak tahen; amate in kilem natu a thin theampo taw a hanciam kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, Topa in thutangte en a, a thungetna uh ngai hi; siatna a vawtte ahile ama in langpan hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pha vawt tu na lawp uh le, akua in hong nasak tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang thumaan nasepna na sep uh ciang ngawngawnin na thuak uh le, bangza in lungdam tu nu ziam! Kuama kiita heak vun a, thinngim heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang na thinsung ah Christ sia thasiana nei tavun. Topa a hina bangin ama vaang pia vun. Na sungah lametna na nei uh sia sonthiang tu in hong dongh khat pawpo na zo thei natu in a tawntung kinging tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ahihang tuabang na son uh ciang, cikna thiamna le kithasiana nei tavun. Na thinsung ah, kithasunna omsak heak vun, tua hile hong kiselno ciangin, Christ nungzuite na hina uh taw na ngamtat phate hong sonsiate sia, amate pauna taw a maizum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian ii deina ahi nale a pha sepna hu a thuakna in, a sia sepna hu a thuakna sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Christ in mawna hu in a tawntung atu khatvei lian thi zo hi, note Pathian kungah hong zot pui natu in mipha khat sia mawneite taangin thi zo hi. Ama pumpi thi ahihang thaa sungah kinungtasak zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang a thaa nuntakna taw ama pai in, thaa thongtaakte munah thuhil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi thaa te sia Noah ii teambaw a sak lai hun a, Pathian ii thin uai takin a ngak, Pathian thu a ni nuam ngawlte ii thaa te ahi hi. Teambaw sungah mihing tawmno — a vekpi in liat bek — tui in laamto in suaktasak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tua tui sia tu in note hong kingupna lim a lak, tui kiphumna ahi hi. Pumpi tung ciniinte silthiangna hi ngawlin, thinsung khentel theina pha taw Pathian tungah kamciam piakna ahi hi. Tua in Jesus Christ thawkikna tungtawn a note hong ngum hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ama, vantung ah pai zo a, Pathian ii ziatsang ah om in, vantunglalangte, vantung thuneite le vaang neite theampo uk siat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Christ in a pumpi ngim thuak ahikom in, note zongh ama khua ngaisutna bangma nei in noma le noma na kithahatsak nanak vun; banghang ziam cile a kuama po pumpi taw a thuak sate sia, mawna sungah a tualta nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu pan kipanin, na leitung nuntakna uh a om laiteng, mihing ii deinate in uksak heak vun a, Pathian ii deina in uksak hamtang vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A bosa hun sungah Pathian he ngawlte ii sep nop teng, a khomin seam zo nu hi. Na nuntakna uh sia, zummawk ngamtatna, sikvilna, zu khamna, uangtatna, zuneakna, a thasiathuai milim biaknate taw zangh zo nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu in Pathian he ngawlte in amate sansak po maitat, loklenna sungah na kihel nop nawn ngawl uh ciang, lamdang sa in note hong selno uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang a nungtate le a thisate tungah thukhen tu in a kingingta sa Pathian mai ah amate in thusitna thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing khat sim tungah, thu kikhen ahi bangma in, amate pumpi nuntakna tungah thu a kikhen sa hi a, a thite zongh Lungdamna Thupha a kihilna sia, tua thu hang ahi hi; amate thaa nuntakna sungah Pathian nuntak bangin, a nuntak thei natu thu a kihil ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na theampo a bo natu hun hong nai zo hi. Thu na nget thei natu in noma le noma ki uk thiamin, na pilvang tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khat le khat thinsung takpi taw na ki it tu sia thupi ngaisutbel tavun, banghang ziam cile ki itna in mawna tam mama sincip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phun ngawlin khat le khat zin kido thiam tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing sim in Pathian letsong tuatuamte a zeak thiampa bangin, Pathian tung pan a tuam vilvel na saan uh letsongte sia ngualdangte phattuam natu in zangh hamtang vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuhil pawpo in Pathian ii ngupna thute hil nanak tahen a; na theampo ah Jesus Christ tungtawnin Pathian tungah pokna a kipiak thei natu in, na a seam pawpo in Pathian piak thangui thatang taw seam nanak tahen, tua Pathian tungah minthanna le vaangletna a tawntung a tawntungin om tahen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka it lawmte awng, a haksa ze etna na thuak uh hu in, lamdang sa heak vun, a piang ngeingawl thute no tungah hong piang bangin ngaisun heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Christ ii vaangletna hong kilangh ciangin, lungdamna a cingin na nga thei natu in, ama thuaknate thuakpui na hi uh komin, lungdam zaw tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Christ ii nungzui na hi uh hu in hong kizawngsak ahile, na lungdam tu uh hi; tua in a vaanglian Thaa ahi Pathian Thaa Thiangtho in no tungah a om hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note sungah khat po in ngimna a thuak le zong, ama sia mihing a that, a nguta, khialna lian a vawt, tua ahibuale, midang a kamkup nop hu hi heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahizong Tapidaw na hi uh hu in a thuak na hi uh le, maizum in nei heak vun, Christ minpu na hi uh hu in, Pathian tungah lungdamko tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thukhen kipat tu hun hong tung zo a, Pathian aituam mihingte sia thu kikhen masa tu hi. Eite taw hong pan le Pathian kung pan hong pai Lungdamna Thupha a um ngawlte bang suak thong tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Laithiangtho in: “Miphate a kingup tu haksa hi; tua ahile Pathian a sel mawneite bang suak tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Pathian ii deina a om hu in a thuakte ahile, a kamciam a peal ngeingawl, amate a Bitphuapa sungah, a ngamtat phatnate taw amate le amate kipummuan tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawlpi upa khat ahi keima in no pawlpi upate tungah kong thuum hi. Keima sia Christ thuakna ii tetti khat ka hi a, maisang hong kilangh tu minthanna a nga tu khat ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uuk ngawl pipina taw hi ngawlin Pathian hong deisak bangin, uukna takpi taw Pathian hong piak tuuhonte keam tavun ci in kong thuum hi. Na nasep uh sia thasum saan natu lel hi ngawlin, uukna takpi taw a seam hi tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noma ii kep tu a hong ki aapte tungah zawthawkna taw uk tu hanciam ngawlin, tuuhon atu in a ettee pha na hizaw vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang Tuucing Pipa hong kilangh ciangin, a taanna a bo ngeingawl tu minthanna lukhu na saang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in no khangmoizawte zongh, khanghaamzawte thu na ni vun. Tuaciangin note theampo khat le khat, na na kisepsak thei natu in, kiniam khiakna awmdal sia puan bangin silh tavun; banghang ziam cile, laithiangtho in, “Pathian in a kiphasakte nalh a, a kiniamkhiakte tungah maipha pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian ii thahatna khutnuai ah kiniamkhiak vun, tua hile ama ii hunpha hong tun ciangin ama in hong laamto tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in note hong thinnuam maw ahikom, na thinngimna theampo ama aap vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilvang vun a, encik vilvel vun! Na ngalpa Doaimangpa sia a valhlup tu khat po zong a, a hawk tawpi taw kibangin, na kiimkot ah hong vak kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na upna sungah kip vun a, ama na nalh vun, banghang ziam cile, leitung theampo a om na thu uppuite zongh a kibang ngimnate thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang tawmvei na thuak zawk uh ciangin, Christ taw pumkhat hina taw, ama ii a bomaw minthanna nga tu a hong sam, thuthiamna theampo ii Pathian, ama mama in no hong cialcingsak tu a, kipsakna, thahatna le, bul khona hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama tungah vaangletna om tawntung tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thumaan Tapidaw suapui in ka ngaisut Silas ii hong huna taw, hi lai tomno kong at hi. Hi thu sia Pathian ii thuthiamna tatak hi ci in tetti pangin, kong hanthawn hi. Tua thu sungah kho takin ding vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian teal ahi, Babylon khua ah a om, na pawlpike ii hong paupui bangma in ka tapa Mark zongh in hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tapidaw ki it kinapna taw khat le khat kimuak tavun. Christ neisa ahi note theampo tungah thinnopna hong om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
